        "digital_output",
        "led_neopixel"
      ],
      "notes": "PIN_NEOPIXEL — onboard single addressable NeoPixel (WS2812), output-only data line. Power is separately gated by GPIO11 (NEOPIXEL_POWER, must be driven HIGH by sketch code — not exposed as a pin, see pins_arduino.h). Confirmed via Seeed's own wiki pinout table (RGB LED -> GPIO12), arduino-pico's pins_arduino.h, and independent community docs (TinyGo, NuttX).\nCheck if available on board"
    },
