      ],
      "notes": "PIN_LED_G — onboard 3-channel user LED, green channel, active-low (confirmed via Seeed's own wiki pinout table USER_LED_G -> GPIO16 and NuttX/community docs: LOW = LED on).\nCheck if available on board"
